            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Uninstalling an app that needs your administrator password to remove its leftovers (e.g. Stats) now asks for it. Previously the app was deleted but Homebrew kept its record, so it stayed in the Uninstall and Updates lists</li>
<li>After a successful upgrade, old versions and downloads of the upgraded Homebrew packages are now cleaned up, so they no longer pile up on disk</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
